templates.critique_response:
Someone in the community has a question about the rule you proposed: "{current_policy}" — {current_operationalization}

Their question: {question}

Answer it, and restate your proposal in full — revised if your answer changes anything about it, otherwise exactly as it was.

Respond with ONLY this JSON object, nothing else:
{{"answer": "<your answer, in character>", "revised_policy": "<your policy, revised if needed, otherwise unchanged>", "revised_operationalization": "<your operationalization, revised if needed, otherwise unchanged>", "reasoning": "<optional, why you answered this way>"}}

templates.critique_finalize:
The community has been discussing gaps in the rule you proposed. Here's what came up:
{dialogue_summary}

Your current draft: "{current_policy}" — {current_operationalization}

Give your final, complete policy and operationalization now, incorporating everything from the discussion above — this is what the whole community will actually vote on next.

Respond with ONLY this JSON object, nothing else:
{{"policy": "<your final policy, one or two sentences>", "operationalization": "<your final operationalization, incorporating the discussion>", "reasoning": "<optional, why this is your final version>"}}
